### PairPrep API Examples (VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP Client)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Healthcheck (Stateless - Never sets cookies or creates sessions)
GET {{baseUrl}}/healthz

### 2. Initiate Google OAuth Flow
# Browser will be redirected to Google Accounts with PKCE code_challenge and state
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/google

### 3. Initiate GitHub OAuth Flow
# Browser will be redirected to GitHub OAuth authorization with state
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/github

### 4. Get Current User Profile (Unauthenticated -> 401 UNAUTHORIZED)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me

### 5. Get Current User Profile (Authenticated)
# Replace {{pairprep_session}} with your active session cookie value from browser
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me
Cookie: pairprep.sid=your_session_cookie_here

### 6. Update Profile Display Name (Requires CSRF Header)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me
Content-Type: application/json
X-Requested-With: pairprep
Cookie: pairprep.sid=your_session_cookie_here

{
  "displayName": "Alex Developer"
}

### 7. Update Profile Display Name - Missing CSRF Header (Returns 403 CSRF_REJECTED)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: pairprep.sid=your_session_cookie_here

{
  "displayName": "Alex Developer"
}

### 8. Logout (Destroys session in MongoDB and clears cookie)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/logout
X-Requested-With: pairprep
Cookie: pairprep.sid=your_session_cookie_here

### 9. Create Room (Requires CSRF Header & Optional Idempotency Key)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rooms
Content-Type: application/json
X-Requested-With: pairprep
Idempotency-Key: e1a2b3c4-d5e6-4f7a-8b9c-0d1e2f3a4b5c
Cookie: pairprep.sid=your_session_cookie_here

{
  "title": "Algorithms Practice",
  "language": "python"
}

### 10. List My Rooms (Cursor-Paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rooms?limit=10
Cookie: pairprep.sid=your_session_cookie_here

### 11. Get Public Room Metadata (Unauthenticated or Non-Member)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rooms/your_room_slug_here

### 12. Join Room as Guest (Receives HMAC-signed pairprep.guest cookie)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rooms/your_room_slug_here/join
Content-Type: application/json
X-Requested-With: pairprep

{
  "displayName": "Alice Guest"
}

### 13. Join Room as Signed-in User (Session Precedence)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rooms/your_room_slug_here/join
Content-Type: application/json
X-Requested-With: pairprep
Cookie: pairprep.sid=your_session_cookie_here

{
  "displayName": "Alex Developer"
}

### 14. Change Participant Role (Owner Only, Editor or Viewer)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rooms/your_room_slug_here/members/target_member_id_here
Content-Type: application/json
X-Requested-With: pairprep
Idempotency-Key: 11111111-2222-4333-8444-555555555555
Cookie: pairprep.sid=owner_session_cookie_here

{
  "role": "viewer"
}

### 15. Remove Participant from Room (Owner Only)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rooms/your_room_slug_here/members/target_member_id_here
X-Requested-With: pairprep
Cookie: pairprep.sid=owner_session_cookie_here

### 16. End Room Session (Owner Only, Idempotent)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rooms/your_room_slug_here/end
X-Requested-With: pairprep
Idempotency-Key: 22222222-3333-4444-8555-666666666666
Cookie: pairprep.sid=owner_session_cookie_here

### 17. Delete Room & Cascade All Resources (Owner Only, Cascades Children First)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rooms/your_room_slug_here
X-Requested-With: pairprep
Idempotency-Key: 33333333-4444-4555-8666-777777777777
Cookie: pairprep.sid=owner_session_cookie_here

